  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to an incentive program for companies relocating or operating in PA Industrial Parks (EUR 7 m)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The EU contribution supports the development of a financial incentive program, for companies relocating or operating into PA Industrial Parks. Incentives are disbursed following a PEGASE mechanism, whereby ex-ante and ex-post audits are executed in order to validate beneficiaries&apos; selection, grants&apos; allocation and payments&apos; eligibility.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
